            <div xml:id="d178">

                <pb facs="0275" n="195" xml:id="pg195"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            von Holleben.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington, D. C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Excellency</hi>: I inclose a memorandum by way
                    of reply to that which you did me the honor to leave with me on Saturday and am,
                    as ever, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>


